      "category": "Text",
      "text": "In July of 1962, an Executive Order from Mayor Wagner announced the conversion of our present telephone system to a unified direct inward dialing system known as CENTREX. Since that time, the preliminary work of installing the necessary equipment, surveying the present telephone arrangements and many other necessary details are nearing the completion date. In June of this year, the first phase of this new system will be completed and in turnover for our use.",
